### SlotSwap Auth & Profile Backend Smoke Tests
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@origin = http://localhost:3000

### 1. List Departments (Public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/departments
Origin: {{origin}}

### 2. Register New Student
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}

{
  "name": "Tanvir Rahman",
  "email": "tanvir@northsouth.edu",
  "password": "Password123",
  "studentId": "2024-0012",
  "departmentId": "cmhn6c16h0000r39g40r4v85h",
  "batch": "Spring 2024"
}

### 3. Attempt Login Before Verification (Expects 403 EMAIL_NOT_VERIFIED)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}

{
  "email": "tanvir@northsouth.edu",
  "password": "Password123"
}

### 4. Login with Wrong Password (Expects 401 INVALID_CREDENTIALS)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}

{
  "email": "tanvir@northsouth.edu",
  "password": "WrongPassword999"
}

### 5. Login Unknown Email (Expects 401 INVALID_CREDENTIALS - Same message & constant time)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}

{
  "email": "nonexistent@northsouth.edu",
  "password": "Password123"
}

### 6. Login as Admin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}

{
  "email": "admin@slotswap.example",
  "password": "AdminPassword123"
}

### 7. Get Current User Profile (Admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me
Origin: {{origin}}

### 8. Update Current Profile (Valid fields)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}

{
  "name": "System Administrator",
  "phone": "+8801700000000",
  "contactVisibility": "AFTER_CONFIRMATION",
  "preferredDays": ["SUN", "TUE", "THU"],
  "preferredTimeRange": "MORNING",
  "allowMultiWaySwaps": true
}

### 9. Update Profile - Rejection of Illegal Keys (Expects 400 VALIDATION_ERROR)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}

{
  "role": "ADMIN",
  "status": "SUSPENDED",
  "studentId": "HACKED-999"
}

### 10. List Active Sessions
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/sessions
Origin: {{origin}}

### 11. Resend Verification Email (Returns 200 for existing and non-existing)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/resend-verification
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}

{
  "email": "tanvir@northsouth.edu"
}

### 12. Forgot Password (Returns 200)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}

{
  "email": "admin@slotswap.example"
}

### 13. Admin: List Users with Search, Filters & Pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/users?q=admin&page=1&pageSize=20
Origin: {{origin}}

### 14. Admin: Attempt to Suspend/Delete Self (Expects 403 FORBIDDEN)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/users/cmhn6c16h0000r39g40r4v85h
Origin: {{origin}}

### 15. Cross-Origin Request Rejection (Expects 403 FORBIDDEN)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: http://evil-site.com

{
  "email": "admin@slotswap.example",
  "password": "AdminPassword123"
}

### 16. Logout
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout
Origin: {{origin}}
